Package: Panoptes
Type: Package
Title: Database Platform Compatibility for HADES
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anthony", "Sena", email = "sena@ohdsi.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Observational Health Data Science and Informatics", role = c("cph"))
  )
Description: Helps Health Analytics Data-to-Evidence Suite ('HADES') package
    maintainers explicitly declare and verify support for database platforms.
    Named after Argus Panoptes, the many-eyed guardian of Greek mythology, it
    provides a consistent view of database compatibility across the HADES
    ecosystem. It validates platform declarations, resolves a normalized
    environment-variable interface, constructs 'DatabaseConnector' test
    contexts, scopes test resources, and detects drift between declarations
    and continuous-integration matrices.
